msgid "Using this option prevents subscribers from having to repeatedly sign up for notifications when a product becomes available in limited quantities after going out of stock. For instance, if there are 100 subscribers signed up for notifications and only 10 units are expected to be restocked at a time, enabling this option ensures that those subscribers won't need to re-register for notifications each time the product is restocked"
