msgid "When a product is restocked with only a few units, notify just the earliest subscribers instead of everyone. For example: 100 subscribers are waiting and you restock 5 units, only the first 5 subscribers are notified. The remaining 95 stay on the waitlist and are notified automatically on the next restock, they do not need to subscribe again."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:837
